Package: local-optimize
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates, python3 (>= 3.12), python3-pip, python3-venv
Description: local-first MCP/RAG memory for AI agents
 Local Optimize provides scoped PostgreSQL/pgvector retrieval, GraphRAG,
 local Intel XPU reranking and local-only Ollama/MCP integration.
 .
 This package installs application files and inactive user service templates.
 Model weights, Python virtual environments, secrets and agent configuration
 are managed separately and are not created by the package installation.
